00:10:03.723 --> 00:10:04.303
Trust me.

00:10:06.128 --> 00:10:06.428
Lola.

00:10:07.548 --> 00:10:10.669
It turned out a Russian thug was one of her jobs.

00:10:11.169 --> 00:10:12.350
He told her everything.

00:10:12.870 --> 00:10:19.672
How a Russian crime gang was bringing in a special shipment through Klypata and our local gangs were fighting for a piece of the action.

00:10:20.752 --> 00:10:24.033
But the Russians weren't about to roll over and make any payoffs.

00:10:28.554 --> 00:10:29.635
Too bad about Lola.

00:10:31.275 --> 00:10:33.116
But her tip was right on the money.

00:10:41.703 --> 00:10:51.669
The chief detective of Lithuania's port city had not a clue to what triggered the gang war but a police informer told him about a mysterious shipment from Russia something

00:10:51.689 --> 00:10:53.610
of great value to important people.

00:10:54.850 --> 00:11:04.076
Too bad but her tip was right on money whatever it was was stashed right under our nose the Lithuanian bank

