To clear the bank,

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:10.861
I used the cover of a bomb...

00:11:10.881 --> 00:11:11.161
...throwing tile.

00:11:12.422 --> 00:11:15.183
I didn't know how close to the truth that was.

00:11:16.323 --> 00:11:18.144
