00:12:55.133 --> 00:12:55.954
Interestingly,

00:12:56.475 --> 00:12:59.678
many consider Sverdlovsk the gangster capital of Russia.

00:13:00.739 --> 00:13:05.563
Its industries rely on mineral resources and military-industrial complexes.

00:13:08.252 --> 00:13:12.256
But now Russia hasn't enough money to pay its nuclear scientists and engineers.

00:13:13.897 --> 00:13:16.680
A prescription for corruption by the nuclear mafia.

00:13:17.961 --> 00:13:20.083
Do you have a cigarette?

00:13:20.084 --> 00:13:25.148
I found out how easy it was when I talked to the head of the nuclear materials division.

00:13:25.149 --> 00:13:25.568
Detective,

00:13:26.049 --> 00:13:26.489
I tell you,

00:13:26.809 --> 00:13:28.311
I did nothing illegal.

00:13:32.464 --> 00:13:33.865
As chief of the department,

00:13:34.205 --> 00:13:37.788
I know what surplus materials we have at our nuclear facilities.

00:13:39.049 --> 00:13:43.412
I heard that a facility in Obnisk was storing extra beryllium.

00:13:43.572 --> 00:13:49.217
And if you would take the time to review our confusing government policies,

00:13:49.597 --> 00:13:55.782
