00:13:56.502 --> 00:13:57.843
Then talk me through the process.

00:13:59.548 --> 00:14:03.930
I simply had to get order form from headquarters in Moscow.

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:06.491
Minotome has a branch in Moscow.

00:14:07.231 --> 00:14:13.794
From the printing press I got papers without the Minotome letterhead on it and that's how it started.

