00:39:27.053 --> 00:39:32.294
And by comparison with the blast and heat effects that come out of such a device,

00:39:34.206 --> 00:39:39.449
The neutrons are all dominating and they also have to be people killers.

00:39:41.230 --> 00:39:44.852
But they're able to kill people without destroying.

00:39:46.253 --> 00:39:48.094
While working with a defense establishment,

00:39:48.294 --> 00:39:50.675
Sam Cohen invented a pure fusion device.

00:39:51.056 --> 00:39:53.437
It was called the Neutron Bomb.

00:39:55.358 --> 00:40:01.482
The device can be so light and so small that it could be...

00:40:02.522 --> 00:40:04.023
Roughly the size of a baseball.

00:40:05.184 --> 00:40:06.005
Now it'll weigh more.

00:40:07.066 --> 00:40:08.127
It may weigh as much as

00:40:08.567 --> 00:40:09.368
7, 8,

00:40:09.388 --> 00:40:10.989
10 pounds or something like that.

00:40:11.429 --> 00:40:13.271
But from a terrorist standpoint,

00:40:13.511 --> 00:40:13.751
you know,

00:40:13.791 --> 00:40:17.515
here is not a suitcase bomb.

00:40:17.655 --> 00:40:20.337
Here is a bowling ball bag bomb,

00:40:20.338 --> 00:40:20.737
you know,

00:40:20.817 --> 00:40:21.398
practically.

00:40:22.419 --> 00:40:23.920
You could almost carry it in your pocket.

00:40:25.861 --> 00:40:29.945
If you had the same material in Europe,

00:40:30.545 --> 00:40:31.286
nuclear material,

00:40:31.446 --> 00:40:33.987
that's in Europe and you wanted to get it to the United States,

00:40:34.087 --> 00:40:37.629
the easiest path is the path of least resistance.

00:40:38.770 --> 00:40:49.156
Bring it across the Mexican border and use the organizations in Mexico that bring everything else into this country that is contraband.

00:40:54.299 --> 00:41:00.562
One pint-sized neutron bomb is capable of annihilating the population of a downtown district or government facility.

00:41:02.174 --> 00:41:09.641
A few suitcase-sized neutron bombs smuggled in by the mafia for a terrorist group would be enough to hold a city hostage.

00:41:11.243 --> 00:41:14.226
They have no conscience about what crosses our border.

00:41:15.367 --> 00:41:15.908
They'll bring it,

00:41:16.909 --> 00:41:19.651
and they've never shown a conscience about that.

00:41:20.132 --> 00:41:26.338
So the prospect of nuclear material entering the United States through the southern border...

00:41:26.949 --> 00:41:30.251
is highly probable.

00:41:30.252 --> 00:41:43.759
I think the simplest way to smuggle that kind of material in the United States is to label it for what it is and bring it in as a legitimate commercial shipment such as medical materials that are radioactive.

00:41:47.641 --> 00:41:50.023
We're running ahead,

00:41:50.083 --> 00:41:50.483
hopefully,

00:41:50.563 --> 00:41:53.205
of a terrorist that's trying to acquire these nuclear materials.

00:41:57.885 --> 00:41:59.626
We know our systems have been in place.

00:41:59.786 --> 00:42:05.470
We know that they have prevented and detected attempted diversions of nuclear materials.

00:42:15.657 --> 00:42:21.261
Produce an awful lot of damage as a terrorist weapon or as a dream battlefield.

00:42:22.422 --> 00:42:26.344
But what worries me most of all is terrorism.

00:42:29.737 --> 00:42:39.186
The development and manufacture and proliferation of such devices is perfectly legal in terms of the nuclear arms control agreements.

00:42:44.150 --> 00:42:48.093
We feel like we're doing a very good job,

00:42:48.414 --> 00:42:49.375
the best job we can,

00:42:50.616 --> 00:42:54.880
of making sure that those materials don't find their way into the hands of a terrorist organization.

00:43:02.453 --> 00:43:11.259
The aspect of finding that without specific information and the odds of finding it just on happenstance are astronomical.

00:43:23.985 --> 00:43:27.530
If an improvised nuclear device is ever used in this country,

00:43:28.110 --> 00:43:28.591
or in

00:43:29.112 --> 00:43:30.494
Paris or London,

00:43:31.996 --> 00:43:36.622
that it will fundamentally change Western civilization in ways that we cannot even anticipate.

00:43:51.145 --> 00:43:55.531
Civilization may be able to withstand a certain amount of drug smuggling and black market trade,

00:43:56.493 --> 00:43:59.797
but if a nuclear warhead fell into the hands of criminal terrorists,

00:44:00.038 --> 00:44:03.483
it would be a cataclysmic threat to both the public and to world peace.

00:44:05.085 --> 00:44:05.866
I'm Robert Stack.

00:44:06.547 --> 00:44:07.428
Thanks for joining us.

